            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Grotesque Gift"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(olfactory)\n\nA draugr's attacks spatter their targets with rancid flesh and rotting seaweed.\n\nA creature damaged by a draugr's Strike must succeed at a DC 15 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure)."
